# Peacemakers core

Before recommending or building solutions in this repo:

1. Inspect existing code and docs first; do not assume features from prompts.
2. Understand before recommending; simplify before automating; configure before replacing; existing tools before new purchases.
3. Prefer deterministic automation when rules suffice; introduce AI only when justified.
4. Minimum authority for any AI/agent; consequential actions must be observable, attributable, reversible where feasible, and human-governed.
5. Measure business improvement; never fabricate ROI.

Canonical standards: `owner-ops/docs/peacemakers-operating-system/`.  
Preserve: `owner-ops/docs/future-recommendation-philosophy.md` and related future-* contracts.
